            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Electricity domestic net consumption shares are based on annual averages for 2023. Losses are distributed across voltage levels with total losses for the same time frame as well as older proxy data for disaggregation. The transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O) are also included. Remark: This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on older UCTE data. UUID: 9ddbffa7-7126-33b6-9b58-3bb4395ebbde</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
